WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:04.567
-Damning new documentary footage
of key Trump ally, Roger Stone,

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:06.834
discussing plans
for a violent coup to overturn

00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:09.634
the 2020 election has emerged
thanks to the committee

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:11.701
investigating the January 6th
insurrection.

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:13.968
Meanwhile, the committee
is still reportedly

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:16.634
debating some of its biggest
unanswered questions,

00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:19.334
including whether to subpoena
Mike Pence or Trump himself.

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:21.868
For more on this,
it's time for a closer look.

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:26.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.701
The committee investigating

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:29.567
the January 6th attack
on the Capitol

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:31.767
was supposed to have held
its ninth public hearing today,

00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:33.901
but delayed the hearing due
to Hurricane Ian.

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.934
The delay also gives
the committee more time

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:38.133
to resolve
some major questions,

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:40.934
namely whether or not
to subpoena key figures

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:43.801
like Mike Pence
or even Donald Trump himself.

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:46.367
-Preparations for the hearing
come at a critical moment

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:49.234
for the committee with very big
unanswered questions

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:50.667
for the committee's members

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:52.634
as they prepare to wrap
its work up

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:53.868
by the end of the year.

00:00:53.868 --> 00:00:55.534
From "The New York Times"
quote --

00:00:55.601 --> 00:00:57.067
"The panel whose public hearings

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:59.868
this summer exposed
substantial new details

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:02.400
about former
President Donald J. Trump's

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.834
efforts to reverse the outcome
of the 2020 election

00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:09.100
must still decide whether to
issue subpoenas to Mr. Trump

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.901
and former VP Mike Pence.

00:01:10.901 --> 00:01:12.934
And it must still grapple with

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:16.133
when to turn its files over
to the Justice Department,

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:17.434
how to finish what it hopes

00:01:17.434 --> 00:01:19.634
will be a comprehensive
written report

00:01:19.634 --> 00:01:21.501
and whether to make criminal --

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:24.167
I'm gonna say it again --
criminal referrals."

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:26.267
-Don't worry, you don't need
to say it again.

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:29.200
The only referrals Trump
is getting these days

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.334
are criminal referrals.

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:34.100
Can you imagine someone writing
a job referral for Trump?

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:45.968
I can't imagine Trump gets
many customer referrals either.

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:47.801
I doubt any of his businesses

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:49.801
will be getting any
five-star reviews on Yelp

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:51.567
unless it's from
one of his weirdo pals.

00:02:18.133 --> 00:02:20.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:22.934
You know it.

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:25.434
Anyway, I gotta be honest.

00:02:25.434 --> 00:02:26.734
If I was on the committee,

00:02:26.734 --> 00:02:28.901
I'm not sure where I'd land
on the question

00:02:28.901 --> 00:02:30.067
of whether to subpoena Trump.

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:31.634
I mean, on the one hand,

00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:34.133
it would be great to get him
under oath on camera

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:35.767
so you could make him
answer questions

00:02:35.767 --> 00:02:38.300
in front of the American public
under the threat of perjury.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.767
On the other hand, he's not
gonna answer questions

00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:42.334
under threat of perjury.

00:02:42.334 --> 00:02:44.701
Putting Trump on the stand
is as good an idea

00:02:44.701 --> 00:02:47.834
as putting a chimpanzee
in a school play.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:51.400
He's not gonna stick
to the script.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.968
Yeah, the beginning was fun

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:54.801
when the monkey
came out in a costume,

00:02:54.801 --> 00:02:58.167
but then it got weird and scary.

00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:01.133
Trump can't even answer softball
questions from his friends

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:04.234
on Fox News without going off
on deranged tangents.

00:03:04.234 --> 00:03:07.167
Here's a quick highlight reel
from a softball interview

00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:08.801
he did with Sean Hannity
last week.

00:03:08.801 --> 00:03:11.200
And I should note,
none of the answers here

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:14.901
had anything to do with the
questions that preceded them.

00:03:14.901 --> 00:03:17.167
-You could go all over Hollywood
and try

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:19.901
and get somebody to play
the role of President Xi,

00:03:19.901 --> 00:03:22.767
the president of China.
There is no actor like that.

00:03:22.767 --> 00:03:24.033
There's nobody like that.

00:03:24.033 --> 00:03:27.667
The media said,
"Why does he call this person?"

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:30.734
I call this person, because
that's where the action is.

00:03:30.734 --> 00:03:35.267
Letitia James, she had a --
she had a focus on murder

00:03:35.267 --> 00:03:36.467
and crime in New York,

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:38.534
where they walk
into stores with axes,

00:03:38.534 --> 00:03:40.701
and they start swinging
the axes at people.

00:03:40.701 --> 00:03:42.934
They wanted to rip down
all the statues in this country,

00:03:42.934 --> 00:03:45.400
including
the Jefferson Memorial,

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.601
the Lincoln Memorial.

00:03:46.601 --> 00:03:48.300
I mean, it's not
even believable.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.501
-No, it's not.

00:03:50.501 --> 00:03:52.267
You want us
to believe protesters

00:03:52.267 --> 00:03:55.767
were gonna try to tear
down the Lincoln Memorial?

00:03:55.767 --> 00:03:59.667
It seems like that's the most
topple-proof statue we got.

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:01.234
That's how smart Lincoln was.

00:04:01.234 --> 00:04:03.334
They said, "We're gonna make
a statue of you standing up."

00:04:03.334 --> 00:04:06.133
And he said,
"Nah, dawg, I'm too tall.

00:04:06.133 --> 00:04:07.400
I'm too tall
and skinny for that,

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.901
a strong breeze
would take me down,

00:04:08.901 --> 00:04:11.868
put me in a wide-ass chair.

00:04:11.868 --> 00:04:16.467
I'm just going to sit down
low in a big old chair.

00:04:16.467 --> 00:04:19.300
Get my butt down
in the cushion.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:22.367
Best of luck, protesters."

00:04:22.367 --> 00:04:24.934
Also, what the hell is
Trump talking about

00:04:24.934 --> 00:04:28.767
when he says people in
New York City are swinging axes?

00:04:28.767 --> 00:04:31.100
Did they accidentally watch
"House of the Dragon"

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.400
and think it was the news?

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.534
[ Imitating Trump ] Have you
seen what's happening

00:04:33.534 --> 00:04:35.434
in New York City?

00:04:35.434 --> 00:04:36.934
People are wearing gold cloaks.

00:04:36.934 --> 00:04:38.300
They're having sword fights.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.334
They put a ponytail
on Doctor Who.

00:04:40.334 --> 00:04:42.501
It's so sad.

00:04:42.501 --> 00:04:43.734
Doctor Who --

00:04:43.734 --> 00:04:46.434
I would never in
a million years -- Doctor Who.

00:04:46.434 --> 00:04:50.267
I saw that,
I said, "Doctor what?"

00:04:50.267 --> 00:04:51.367
And they have him --

00:04:51.367 --> 00:04:54.701
New York City has
a major dragon problem.

00:04:54.701 --> 00:04:56.100
Letitia James, you know, she's
--

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:59.701
they should be doing
something about the dragons.

00:04:59.701 --> 00:05:01.767
[ Normal voice ] Can you imagine
that guy sitting down

00:05:01.767 --> 00:05:03.234
for a televised
congressional hearing?

00:05:03.234 --> 00:05:04.634
It would take days.

00:05:04.634 --> 00:05:06.701
The networks would have
to preempt all their programing

00:05:06.701 --> 00:05:09.767
just so Trump could ramble
about statues or ax murderers

00:05:09.767 --> 00:05:11.567
or windmills or toilets
that don't flush.

00:05:11.567 --> 00:05:14.767
Although it would be nice
to get him under oath

00:05:14.767 --> 00:05:17.334
about the toilets
he's always talking about.

00:05:17.334 --> 00:05:19.667
Mr. President,
you have repeatedly said

00:05:19.667 --> 00:05:21.400
you have to flush toilets
10 times,

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.133
15 times because of
the lack of water pressure.

00:05:24.133 --> 00:05:25.601
Is that actually true?

00:05:25.601 --> 00:05:26.767
[ Imitating Trump ] Yes.

00:05:26.767 --> 00:05:28.267
[ Normal voice ]
Is it possible, sir,

00:05:28.267 --> 00:05:30.100
that rather
than being the toilet's fault?

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.501
They are, in fact,
not designed to flush letters

00:05:32.501 --> 00:05:36.968
from dictators and manila
envelopes full of state secrets?

00:05:36.968 --> 00:05:40.067
[ Imitating Trump ] I would like
to plead the Fifth.

00:05:40.067 --> 00:05:41.334
[ Normal voice ] So there are
still some key decisions

00:05:41.334 --> 00:05:43.234
remaining for the January 6th
committee to make.

00:05:43.234 --> 00:05:45.267
But what they've already
discovered has been shocking.

00:05:45.267 --> 00:05:46.767
And there's apparently
more to come.

00:05:46.767 --> 00:05:48.634
For example, one of the central
characters in the next hearing

00:05:48.634 --> 00:05:51.634
was supposed to have been
Trump ally Roger Stone.

00:05:51.634 --> 00:05:54.634
And now we have damning
new documentary footage of Stone

00:05:54.634 --> 00:05:57.801
openly discussing plans
for a violent coup

00:05:57.801 --> 00:05:59.667
before the 2020 election.

00:05:59.667 --> 00:06:01.167
Stone laid out in detail months

00:06:01.167 --> 00:06:03.734
before the election
how the Trump team would refuse

00:06:03.734 --> 00:06:05.868
to accept the results,
claim the election was stolen,

00:06:05.868 --> 00:06:07.501
and use the courts
to overturn the results

00:06:07.501 --> 00:06:09.400
and even throw out
the real electors

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.400
who showed up
to the Electoral College,

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:12.601
count on January 6th,

00:06:12.601 --> 00:06:15.667
and replace
them with phony Trump electors.

00:06:15.667 --> 00:06:18.033
-What they're assuming is that
the election will be normal.

00:06:18.033 --> 00:06:19.534
The election will not be normal.

00:06:19.534 --> 00:06:21.167
Oh, these are
the California results.

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:22.400
Sorry, we're not accepting them.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.801
We're challenging them in court.

00:06:23.801 --> 00:06:26.834
If you like to show up
at the Electoral College.

00:06:26.834 --> 00:06:28.367
Armed guards
will throw them out.

00:06:28.367 --> 00:06:29.834
I'm the president [Bleep] you.

00:06:29.834 --> 00:06:30.834
You're not stealing Florida.

00:06:30.834 --> 00:06:31.868
You're not stealing --

00:06:31.868 --> 00:06:32.934
I'm challenging all of it.

00:06:32.934 --> 00:06:34.200
And the judges we're going to

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.934
are judges I appointed.

00:06:35.934 --> 00:06:38.100
[Bleep] you, you're not stealing
the election.

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:40.734
-Why do these guys all explain
their criminal schemes out loud

00:06:40.734 --> 00:06:43.300
and highly specific details
before they do them?

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.701
I want to make sure there's
a camera here before I start.

00:06:45.701 --> 00:06:48.000
They're like Bond villains
spelling out

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.467
exactly how they're gonna
kill him

00:06:49.467 --> 00:06:51.133
right before he slips out
of his handcuffs.

00:06:51.133 --> 00:06:53.367
Just don't get tips
on being a bad guy

00:06:53.367 --> 00:06:54.467
from Christoph Waltz.

00:06:54.467 --> 00:06:55.567
[ Imitating Waltz ]
You see, James,

00:06:55.567 --> 00:06:57.467
you will have your hands
tied to this chain

00:06:57.467 --> 00:06:59.400
from where you will dangle above
a pool of sharks

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.901
while I hack into
the Bank of England,

00:07:00.901 --> 00:07:02.300
and -- Oh, wait, he's gone.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:05.834
[ Normal voice ] Now, just
a quick little sidenote here.

00:07:05.834 --> 00:07:08.200
As I've explained before, some
of our less charitable viewers

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.734
have complained that
my Christoph Waltz

00:07:09.734 --> 00:07:11.667
sounds more like Werner Herzog.

00:07:11.667 --> 00:07:13.501
And to those people,
I would just like to say.

00:07:13.501 --> 00:07:14.801
-[Bleep] you.

00:07:14.801 --> 00:07:16.934
[ Laughter ]

00:07:16.934 --> 00:07:20.300
-Not only

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.601
does it not sound
like Werner Herzog,

00:07:22.601 --> 00:07:25.334
it barely sounds
like Christoph Waltz.

00:07:25.334 --> 00:07:27.367
[ Laughter ]

00:07:27.367 --> 00:07:29.567
Also a bizarre detail in
this whole Roger Stone thing

00:07:29.567 --> 00:07:32.434
is that he gave these interviews
to a Danish film crew

00:07:32.434 --> 00:07:34.100
for a documentary
for some reason.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:37.334
In fact, CNN interviewed
the Danish filmmakers this week

00:07:37.334 --> 00:07:39.667
who explained that staffers
for the January 6th committee

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:41.934
also visited them in Copenhagen

00:07:41.934 --> 00:07:43.868
as part of their investigation
into the coup attempt.

00:07:43.868 --> 00:07:45.000
-Joining me now, the filmmakers

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.567
of "A Storm Foretold".

00:07:46.567 --> 00:07:49.901
Christoffer Gulbrandsen is the
film's director and producer,

00:07:49.901 --> 00:07:53.000
and Frederik Marbell
is the director of photography.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.834
You were contacted
and then subpoenaed

00:07:54.834 --> 00:07:56.834
by the January 6th committee.

00:07:56.834 --> 00:07:58.167
What happened when they came?

00:07:58.167 --> 00:08:00.334
They came to
meet you in Copenhagen, right?

00:08:00.334 --> 00:08:01.934
-Correct.
-What happened?

00:08:01.934 --> 00:08:06.100
-Well, they came four lawyers

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:10.567
from the committee
and questioned us

00:08:10.567 --> 00:08:11.767
for four days.

00:08:11.767 --> 00:08:14.534
And we then had a discussion

00:08:14.534 --> 00:08:17.200
about what their point
of interests were

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:19.067
and what they were looking into.

00:08:19.067 --> 00:08:24.601
And we tried to accommodate what
they needed to do their work.

00:08:24.601 --> 00:08:26.367
-After everyone
on the January 6th committee

00:08:26.367 --> 00:08:28.367
has had to talk to,
it must've been so pleasant

00:08:28.367 --> 00:08:30.667
to chat with
Danish documentary filmmakers.

00:08:30.667 --> 00:08:34.133
I mean, they've had to depose
Bill Barr, Rudy Giuliani,

00:08:34.133 --> 00:08:38.367
that ghost that died and came
back as an even paler ghost.

00:08:38.367 --> 00:08:40.267
Also, hats off
to the January 6th staffers

00:08:40.267 --> 00:08:42.067
who managed to convince
their bosses that they needed

00:08:42.067 --> 00:08:45.033
to go to Copenhagen
to get this footage.

00:08:45.033 --> 00:08:48.200
You could have probably
just sent an e-mail.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:51.200
Hey, Mr. Chairman, there's
a damning footage of Roger Stone

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.567
planning the coup in Copenhagen,

00:08:52.567 --> 00:08:57.601
and the the file
is too big to e-mail.

00:08:57.601 --> 00:08:59.234
So, yeah.

00:08:59.234 --> 00:09:01.167
So we were thinking maybe
the only way to get it

00:09:01.167 --> 00:09:04.167
is to backpack
through Europe for a month.

00:09:04.167 --> 00:09:05.667
We promise to come back
with evidence

00:09:05.667 --> 00:09:07.601
and one of those super-fun
pictures where it looks like

00:09:07.601 --> 00:09:09.100
we're holding up
the Leaning Tower of Pisa.

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:13.634
[ Laughter ]

00:09:13.634 --> 00:09:16.467
We'll wear a suit for it.

00:09:16.467 --> 00:09:20.934
[ Laughter ]

00:09:20.934 --> 00:09:22.968
Yeah, we're gonna
take a Eurail,

00:09:22.968 --> 00:09:25.100
but we're gonna pack,
like, a super-formal suit

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:28.133
for that picture where we hold
up the Leaning Tower of Pisa.

00:09:28.133 --> 00:09:32.033
[ Laughter ]

00:09:32.033 --> 00:09:35.200
But it's insane -- [ Laughs ]

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:36.234
Because, you know --

00:09:36.234 --> 00:09:39.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:39.934 --> 00:09:42.400
But as insane and incriminating
as all of this is,

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.968
nothing is more head-scratching
to me than Stone's response

00:09:44.968 --> 00:09:46.467
to the release
of the documentary footage.

00:09:46.467 --> 00:09:48.634
He claims the footage
is manipulated

00:09:48.634 --> 00:09:50.934
and bizarrely compared himself
to Kim Kardashian.

00:09:50.934 --> 00:09:53.701
-Roger Stone has issued
a lengthy statement

00:09:53.701 --> 00:09:55.968
disputing the authenticity
of all of them,

00:09:55.968 --> 00:09:57.033
saying this...

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.868
-I mean, I'd say you have more
in common with Alanis Morissette

00:10:16.868 --> 00:10:18.834
neither of you seem
to understand

00:10:18.834 --> 00:10:20.067
the definition of ironic.

00:10:20.067 --> 00:10:21.601
[ Laughter ]

00:10:21.601 --> 00:10:23.567
Seriously, what the hell
is he talking --

00:10:23.567 --> 00:10:26.334
Did someone manipulate a video
of Kim Kardashian

00:10:26.334 --> 00:10:28.267
to make it look
like she was planning a coup

00:10:28.267 --> 00:10:31.400
when we all know that would
totally be a Khloé move?

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.667
Also, when a Kardashian
plots a coup,

00:10:34.667 --> 00:10:36.367
do you think they spell coup
with a K?

00:10:36.367 --> 00:10:39.367
I think maybe.

00:10:39.367 --> 00:10:40.667
But here's the thing.

00:10:40.667 --> 00:10:42.968
Stone's call to the violence
wasn't just idle chatter.

00:10:42.968 --> 00:10:44.367
In addition to his friendship
with Trump,

00:10:44.367 --> 00:10:45.701
he's also had ties to right wing

00:10:45.701 --> 00:10:47.300
militia groups
like the Oath Keepers,

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:50.701
whose members are on trial right
now for seditious conspiracy.

00:10:50.701 --> 00:10:52.367
A few weeks ago,
the January 6th committee

00:10:52.367 --> 00:10:54.400
even released real-time audio

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.434
they'd obtained of Oath Keepers
communicating

00:10:57.434 --> 00:11:00.067
during the insurrection
using a walkie-talkie app.

00:11:00.067 --> 00:11:01.434
Some of the memories
you'll hear in this clip

00:11:01.434 --> 00:11:02.567
were there in person

00:11:02.567 --> 00:11:05.000
while others
were watching on television

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.767
and relaying what
they were seeing.

00:11:06.767 --> 00:11:09.434
And specifically, they discussed
one of Trump's tweets

00:11:09.434 --> 00:11:11.300
during the attack,
which they interpreted

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:12.834
as essentially
giving them permission

00:11:12.834 --> 00:11:14.267
to go after members of Congress.

00:11:14.267 --> 00:11:17.834
Also, I would like to note
that as menacing as they sound,

00:11:17.834 --> 00:11:21.067
they are also clearly
giant [Bleep]

